\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O God lf love, O King of peace,
\par Make wars throughout the world to cease;
\par The wrath of sinful man restrain:
\par Give peace, O God, give peace again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Remember, Lord, Thy works of old,
\par The wonders that our fathers told;
\par Remember not our sin's dark strain:
\par Give peace, O God, give peace again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Whom shall we trust but Thee, O Lord?
\par Where rest but on Thy faithful word?
\par None ever called on Thee in vain:
\par Give peace, O God, give peace again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Where saints and angels dwell above,
\par All hearts are knit in holy love;
\par O bind us in that heavenly chain:
\par Give peace, O God, give peace again.
\par                                         Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

